---
import { WHATSAPP_NUMBER } from '../data/games';
---

<section class="relative py-16 md:py-24 px-4 bg-slate-950/50 border-y border-slate-800/50">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-amber-500/5 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <!-- Encabezado de la sección -->
    <div class="text-center mb-10 md:mb-14">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 text-xs font-gaming font-bold tracking-wider mb-4">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
        ANTES DE COMPRAR
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-gaming font-black text-3xl md:text-4xl text-white mb-4">
        ¿Primaria o Secundaria? <span class="text-amber-400">Entiende la diferencia</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm md:text-base">
        Elige la modalidad que mejor se adapte a tu forma de jugar. Ambas son 100% seguras y con garantía.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid de comparación -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8">
      
      <!-- TARJETA: CUENTA SECUNDARIA -->
      <div class="group relative p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-500/10">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
          <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-amber-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1.41 16.09V20h-2.67v-1.93c-1.71-.36-3.16-1.46-3.27-3.4h1.96c.1 1.05.82 1.87 2.65 1.87 1.96 0 2.4-.98 2.4-1.59 0-.83-.44-1.61-2.67-2.14-2.48-.6-4.18-1.62-4.18-3.67 0-1.72 1.39-2.84 3.11-3.21V4h2.67v1.95c1.86.45 2.79 1.86 2.85 3.39H14.3c-.05-1.11-.64-1.87-2.22-1.87-1.5 0-2.4.68-2.4 1.64 0 .84.65 1.39 2.67 1.94s4.18 1.36 4.18 3.85c0 1.89-1.44 2.98-3.12 3.19z"/></svg>
        </div>
        
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-gaming font-black text-xl text-white">Cuenta Secundaria</h3>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-lg mb-6">La opción más económica</p>
          
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Precio significativamente más bajo.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Se juega iniciando sesión con la cuenta que te proporcionamos.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" /></svg>
              <span class="text-amber-200/80"><strong>Requiere conexión a internet</strong> constante para verificar la licencia del juego.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" /></svg>
              <span class="text-amber-200/80">Los trofeos/logros se guardan en la cuenta del juego, no en la tuya.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TARJETA: CUENTA PRIMARIA -->
      <div class="group relative p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-emerald-500/30 hover:border-emerald-500/60 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/10 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 right-6 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-slate-950 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg">
          ⭐ Más Recomendada
        </div>
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
          <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-emerald-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm0 10.99h7c-.53 4.12-3.28 7.79-7 8.94V12H5V6.3l7-3.11v8.8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-gaming font-black text-xl text-white">Cuenta Primaria</h3>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg mb-6">La experiencia completa y sin límites</p>
          
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>El juego se activa y se instala en <strong>tu propia cuenta</strong> personal.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span><strong>No requiere internet</strong> para jugar. Disfruta totalmente offline.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Todos los trofeos, logros y guardados se acumulan en tu perfil.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              <span>Ideal para jugar sin interrupciones y mantener tu progreso al 100%.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Nota al pie -->
    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">¿Aún tienes dudas sobre cuál elegir para ti?</p>
      <a 
        href={`https://wa.me/${WHATSAPP_NUMBER}?text=¡Hola!%20Tengo%20una%20duda%20sobre%20la%20diferencia%20entre%20cuenta%20primaria%20y%20secundaria.%20¿Me%20puedes%20ayudar?`} 
        target="_blank" 
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white font-gaming font-bold text-sm transition-all duration-300 border border-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-500/20"
      >
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z" /></svg>
        Pregúntanos por WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>